MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e109a12f585ae684d8b04bd69c300cd0, type: 3}
  m_Name: L1Q1 Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuestDialogue
  quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1fc845db4b9c244a8094d9ead45e68f, type: 2}
  before:
    lines:
    - Oh no... Where could they be...
    - 'Hey, you! You must be Ruby! '
    - A friend told me someone with green pants and a tail was coming to this island.
      You fit the description!
    - I'd actually really appreciate your help right this moment.
    - You see, I'm a merchant, and a while ago I lost 3 really important boxes with
      valuable goods.
    - Could you help me look for them?
    - By the way, to help you navigate the map, I have a tip for you.
    - You can dash around by pressing E. While dashing, you are briefly immune to
      damage, so make the most of it!
    questToGrantAfter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1fc845db4b9c244a8094d9ead45e68f,
      type: 2}
    onExhausted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  during:
    lines:
    - These boxes are really important...
    questToGrantAfter: {fileID: 0}
    onExhausted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  after:
    lines:
    - You found them! Thank you so much, Ruby!
    - I'm aware that you didn't come to this island just to help a merchant find
      their lost merchandise.
    - You're probably hearing all of this noise coming from these malfunctioning
      Patrol Robots that we have here.
    - "You might want to visit my friend who lives nearby. They\u2019ll be able to
      guide you on what to do next."
    - Follow the pavement northwest, and you're sure to meet them eventually.
    - Take care!
    questToGrantAfter: {fileID: 0}
    onExhausted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
